            <div xml:id="m-a607358f-7e02-4568-867c-37be5c8dcc13">
              <lg xml:id="m-8c76f2cb-7c19-46d5-869d-bc53c427e8a4">
                <l xml:id="m-8ce479b0-e8b4-4a90-872f-d89270f17316" facs="#m-67a41660-7da0-4bb6-934d-f2cd78f47f11" label="ambiguous">562</l><l xml:id="m-dc181318-292b-4b85-b1dd-34a7be395aa4" facs="#m-ea786511-64ac-416e-ac7c-638a38293c01" label="text-like">ath Sunday of Lent.</l><l xml:id="m-60f7fe78-6692-43f4-8e06-71b161b96371" facs="#m-20a8ffe3-9ac3-4e10-9b65-b1cfad95ba09" label="lyrics-like">et usque " in saécu-lum.</l><l xml:id="m-5de5001e-8b4b-4406-843a-d44b5a1cbfc1" facs="#m-a8ac6a2d-84db-4012-bbea-e28767837a15" label="ambiguous">nunc</l><l xml:id="m-407a7e8a-be10-4d74-bcb4-cc7b968a74cf" facs="#m-aba99e2b-2ad8-410f-839e-bbe4f09762c9" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Joannem. Joan. 6.</l><l xml:id="m-cc69fa09-f5ce-4bd5-9292-116979205c7c" facs="#m-6cd932cf-0fd9-4ac9-b1db-0f5bdb8e4929" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Abiit Jesus trans, sunt inter tantos? Dixit ergo lesus:</l><l xml:id="m-dbfaa692-9ae0-46ae-ae83-4ef83d8bf6a3" facs="#m-659e254d-ff4e-44a3-865f-b75e73e4f4a0" label="lyrics-like">L mare Galilaéae, quod est Tibe¬</l><l xml:id="m-051b66ba-9663-4ec1-8383-5303f7f3019c" facs="#m-e8f3490a-5c98-4b3e-b880-e9234ff49785" label="lyrics-like">Fácite hómines discúmbere. Erat</l><l xml:id="m-9bda388b-95c6-43a6-9d43-e40e2dbfb400" facs="#m-2e91fe9d-ab6b-4e4b-854b-bd908860a6b8" label="lyrics-like">riadis: et sequebátur eum multi¬</l><l xml:id="m-3824014d-1722-4ca2-a515-c3bbde07b8e2" facs="#m-cf09bfcc-84d3-4226-b750-001566c2d564" label="ambiguous">autem foenum multum in loco. Dis¬</l><l xml:id="m-b19242a2-ca56-4c7f-8c62-3f1b6a2e9308" facs="#m-4770f25c-1245-41a1-9615-db490f00bbe8" label="lyrics-like">túdo magna, quia vidébant signa,</l><l xml:id="m-26e1dcb7-f663-4a04-b39e-1dc4c5e212a5" facs="#m-100029e3-bc3a-4181-bda6-a8dc64d56206" label="lyrics-like">cubuérunt ergo viri, número quasi</l><l xml:id="m-cc317d4a-dfdf-4512-874f-5fcbe6305e1d" facs="#m-9c91d7ac-eea5-417a-8d86-4f7902815d79" label="lyrics-like">quae faciébat super his, qui infir¬</l><l xml:id="m-fa191dc5-ee18-42eb-8d01-866972a7eb8f" facs="#m-56c53197-a8bd-45c9-a2cd-9c19333ea2d9" label="lyrics-like">quinque millia. Accépit ergo Jesus</l><l xml:id="m-7456362f-97d5-4787-8b4b-63be43e0e459" facs="#m-11174477-5d94-4789-94a6-a958ae51e090" label="lyrics-like">mabántur. Súbiit ergo in montem</l><l xml:id="m-95f28909-f5da-4c67-b001-6fe268d82b5c" facs="#m-353b8ed7-7077-43db-bcc8-0ef02ca466d6" label="lyrics-like">panes: et cum grátias egisset, dis¬</l><l xml:id="m-126374b1-3e28-4cde-b979-c3c8fad03206" facs="#m-c5f316a5-668d-4c7d-9a8a-c3b752dd4fc3" label="lyrics-like">Jesus: et ibi sedébat cum discipulis</l><l xml:id="m-a791218e-14c3-497b-b4d3-c305b7cb625b" facs="#m-d34a303c-c729-4d59-8b87-25a959d77ff1" label="lyrics-like">tribuit discumbéntibus: similiter</l><l xml:id="m-229d4c22-0e0a-4b0a-a749-c58e5ce23b31" facs="#m-7a5dafe0-3c0b-46c3-9dbf-9ac43ed27806" label="lyrics-like">suis. Erat autem próximum Pascha,</l><l xml:id="m-41e951a8-274e-427f-a4c9-a801166b088b" facs="#m-a048deaf-b1af-41ea-9e22-e547fdf020b6" label="lyrics-like">et ex píscibus quantum volébant.</l><l xml:id="m-98816cbb-357b-41f3-878e-d6993c140758" facs="#m-5c919c81-8f96-4b43-a42c-8a841adf6baf" label="lyrics-like">Ut autem impléti sunt, dixit disci¬</l><l xml:id="m-16207d7c-5034-435b-ba2c-0f3093e04d93" facs="#m-4d23698f-9e4d-4ac1-a5f4-949cc0c7dd30" label="lyrics-like">dies festus Judacórum. Cum suble¬</l><l xml:id="m-7f78ea99-bfbe-419d-becd-dd1b2400ef97" facs="#m-867746e2-3c3e-4e13-b41f-8ae8b52fd9b7" label="lyrics-like">pulis suis: Colligite quae superavé¬</l><l xml:id="m-328f2caf-34ba-42ea-95a5-61003d33746d" facs="#m-c42ce84f-c87c-42bf-b659-b7b54f1818fb" label="lyrics-like">vásset ergo óculos Jesus, et vidisset</l><l xml:id="m-6cecb4d0-2bf2-4157-9bb6-c5c2ec3410a1" facs="#m-d6a06c58-efec-4a2c-a0d1-7a2d33d717e4" label="lyrics-like">runt fragménta, ne péreant. Colle¬</l><l xml:id="m-6013063a-4211-41eb-a726-315a46235226" facs="#m-3d63e492-cd31-4abc-96bc-446e8ef8fc33" label="lyrics-like">quia multitúdo máxima venit ad</l><l xml:id="m-d1549558-1c58-479a-bf1f-def10d4e4323" facs="#m-ab941b85-9159-4116-b92d-709fc3ebe9ce" label="ambiguous">eum, dixit ad Philippum: Unde</l><l xml:id="m-a679ce6d-54c2-49f1-b1f7-6ae500620a97" facs="#m-76fd7849-6871-4c44-a7f6-801f4a2776b9" label="lyrics-like">gérunt ergo, et implevérunt duó¬</l><l xml:id="m-016ea95c-0ef4-4f17-b6a8-f7d1ed12e112" facs="#m-39a4b8f6-3b22-4692-8425-9906d01039ea" label="lyrics-like">emémus panes, ut mandúcent hi?</l><l xml:id="m-6bc9bf99-fb65-4930-b491-978e9e61f016" facs="#m-321078a8-501f-41b2-a030-75b16f53ee51" label="lyrics-like">decim cóphinos fragmentórum ex</l><l xml:id="m-f9924063-8e33-4c7e-b78e-1b1071f05e8c" facs="#m-c7e9a603-ba26-4114-bb1e-74fb2f458815" label="lyrics-like">Hoc autem dicébat tentans eum:</l><l xml:id="m-4ffc50b2-be03-4bae-b3a3-12a0273dcc7a" facs="#m-966302fe-46cf-4ba2-8f42-0c6a74bd9171" label="lyrics-like">quinque pánibus hordeáceis quae</l><l xml:id="m-6a678792-910b-4e49-bfe0-9cea7cb1ef43" facs="#m-ba3966d4-9399-407e-8360-84e2983733d1" label="lyrics-like">ipse enim sciébat quid esset factú¬</l><l xml:id="m-386cbf34-9518-4204-8c06-a5d0ad91fabc" facs="#m-b8f86243-e7a3-4995-8044-85575e6a2dee" label="lyrics-like">superfuérunt his, qui manducàve¬</l><l xml:id="m-0e935906-6ac6-4199-98b4-81688e258a7c" facs="#m-0d776e5e-b6b4-472b-be88-aeaf882b56a8" label="lyrics-like">rus. Respóndit ei Philippus: Du¬</l><l xml:id="m-fac57dd5-3b50-4bd8-b27c-1a2f5f3a8278" facs="#m-b873a9b5-92d9-4d7d-878f-b1a8082eb6b2" label="lyrics-like">rant. Illi ergo hómines cum vidis¬</l><l xml:id="m-1d28c4e8-ac5a-4069-ae43-0dd2a5b12ab8" facs="#m-0d52728f-25eb-4632-93ff-f8d3de0494be" label="lyrics-like">sent quod Jesus fécerat signum,</l><l xml:id="m-ec00948a-3484-4502-9d8a-cd4914cea76f" facs="#m-22a1ceeb-6653-4b24-98ca-9f9833a8f944" label="lyrics-like">centórum denariórum panes non</l><l xml:id="m-3219ea78-84c0-4ebc-befa-763004d34db2" facs="#m-1eb72557-e5e7-446c-9d9c-cfc7cfc117f4" label="lyrics-like">dicébant: Quia hic est vere Pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-76902f07-16b4-495a-b9bd-3e1f889fe27b" facs="#m-34505b8f-8ee2-427e-99dc-96b8d6ff7667" label="lyrics-like">sufficiunt eis, ut unusquisque módi¬</l><l xml:id="m-162e08c0-7def-4c58-822c-83f65c7c5e0b" facs="#m-7a604f0d-82b6-49ef-9b4c-1a6e20ce95f2" label="ambiguous">cum quid accipiat. Dicit ei unus ex</l><l xml:id="m-08291811-4d11-4c5f-894c-0b95a8eff485" facs="#m-b3cd544f-e2e5-4c9d-a9f1-2bf78fa6844b" label="lyrics-like">phéta, qui ventúrus est in mundum.</l><l xml:id="m-ae9a4aa2-d97e-4eeb-911d-2d34456c2849" facs="#m-3198edac-69cf-410d-b320-a5373f98cb9b" label="lyrics-like">discípulis ejus, Andréas, frater Si¬</l><l xml:id="m-e7526467-3d0f-489a-b96c-06ffc8c74dbf" facs="#m-133e5dc3-fff8-4c9c-98aa-dd2da2fcc24c" label="lyrics-like">Jesus ergo cum cognovísset, quia</l><l xml:id="m-0e0f547c-86eb-4b21-a132-d8791b04ba01" facs="#m-b4f2cd54-e2f6-4975-a3d2-3d19c2be515c" label="lyrics-like">mónis Petri: Est puer unus hic,</l><l xml:id="m-5cb91b12-ffb4-43c9-9c52-a2453898ab15" facs="#m-1f3940aa-8a77-4072-bd14-81792817c5a9" label="lyrics-like">ventúri essent ut ráperent eum, et</l><l xml:id="m-97f6c4b8-aed4-4306-8e77-cf09734c0156" facs="#m-c9c15aaa-2666-4a88-9ca3-dfe5c84c0ed8" label="lyrics-like">qui habet quinque panes hordeá¬</l><l xml:id="m-8f6745aa-ed8a-4d05-a166-9c750cb6db35" facs="#m-a30e575d-1951-4750-81e3-eb2b838e01a6" label="lyrics-like">fácerent eum regem, fugit iterum</l><l xml:id="m-8919d59e-b1cf-4235-829f-90734eb43262" facs="#m-2e464842-3cc8-42c4-895a-566d6e4d4367" label="ambiguous">ceos, et duos pisces: sed haec quid lin montem ipse solus. Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-2f481186-9e8b-40b2-9557-af983112dbb4" facs="#m-be64a62d-c6de-4e69-a305-fd82a01f6423" label="ambiguous">ofert.</l><l xml:id="m-f458279e-982d-4ddf-bb3f-570d139e001c" facs="#m-780c08b6-c37e-4703-a991-5b1d7ddd96b5" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-d1c70498-d1d2-4c44-8c4f-6ee49dc8613f" facs="#m-a66aacff-840b-4420-8d6e-c745a26a31aa" label="lyrics-like">Audá-te</l><l xml:id="m-08fd0534-bdee-4999-8c15-8ecec9346420" facs="#m-ad0988f9-da97-4f1b-94f7-902f64e78240" label="lyrics-like">*Dómi-num, qui-a be¬ ní-gnus</l><l xml:id="m-2d1b1f14-86cf-42ce-b4b7-e8c6267b4318" facs="#m-cd034bf0-6068-4f68-8fe8-8f28083d4dc1" label="ambiguous">est:</l><l xml:id="m-a35f0a7b-dd98-41d6-8a8e-ef5884b85e7a" facs="#m-6e679033-4708-42c8-83c6-c381eedec668" label="lyrics-like">psál- li- te nó- mini é- jus, quó- ni¬ am</l><l xml:id="m-14e5023f-ab55-4023-91e1-069742cfebbe" facs="#m-3a9f106f-b791-4731-a7f1-5e6e661f67c4" label="ambiguous">it.</l><l xml:id="m-e33db612-e67d-4340-a14a-9522d52bb3f6" facs="#m-7b2afb55-b037-44a0-a77d-373028e0c3af" label="lyrics-like">su- á- vis est : ómni- a quaecúmque vó- lu¬</l><l xml:id="m-28345d18-5b63-4489-a093-8f164b629b09" facs="#m-4beda7a3-a6a5-4f4e-b064-fc4a7f2f255d" label="lyrics-like">fé¬ cit</l><l xml:id="m-17a0a28f-8005-4362-aae0-a29e4ad49a4b" facs="#m-73291fff-f825-4060-b18b-b33f307a65cd" label="lyrics-like">in caé-lo</l><l xml:id="m-e68c9bdf-89b2-4c69-a6d1-ba6d9863b3b0" facs="#m-b31f1de0-122e-4a37-9ea8-475bcce53a9f" label="ambiguous">in</l><l xml:id="m-d6f598ad-acce-4741-8cae-680125615153" facs="#m-f7d6cd08-630d-417c-b92b-951bd035da63" label="ambiguous">et</l><l xml:id="m-278b37ea-6bfd-48b6-8b69-294d3648fb6c" facs="#m-c536da7e-677e-49fb-9307-9e520d525a99" label="lyrics-like">tér- ra.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>